":[{"text":"struct","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"AsyncBroadcastSequence","kind":"identifier"}],"kind":"symbol","identifier":"doc:\/\/Afluent\/documentation\/Afluent\/AsyncBroadcastSequence","url":"\/documentation\/afluent\/asyncbroadcastsequence"}}}